OL,3,GNEWSAUniversal park needs rail link
OL,4,Arestored, says group
OL,5,
OL,6,FA travel group is calling for a 20-mile
OL,7,F(32km) railway line that closed in 1962
OL,8,Fto be reinstated to serve the
OL,9,Fforthcoming Universal theme park which
OL,10,Fit believes could be significantly more
OL,11,Fsuccessful than predicted.
OL,13,FThe British Regional Transport
OL,14,FAssociation (BRTA) said it was time "to
OL,15,Flook again" at restoring the
OL,16,FBedford-Northampton route.
OL,18,FIt wrote to Universal explaining the
OL,19,Fplan which it said represented a
OL,20,F"transformative opportunity - not only
OL,21,Ffor Bedford but for the wider Midlands,
OL,22,FSouth East and East of England".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
