OL,3,GNEWSAUniversal park needs rail link
OL,4,Arestored, says group
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe park, due to open in 2031, on a
OL,7,Fformer brickworks near Bedford, is
OL,8,Fpredicted to attract up to 8.5 million
OL,9,Fvisitors in its first year.
